Manage two-factor authentication and user TOTP recovery

Usage:
  orbit admin totp [command]

Available Commands:
  reset       Reset two-factor TOTP for a user and issue a fresh recovery grant

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for totp

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit admin totp [command] --help" for more information about a command.
